---
// Bagian 10, penutup. Sumber: Pembacaan Diri Dwi Yuda.
//
// Preferensi kerja diambil apa adanya dari catatan: perusahaan dengan proses
// rapi, jadi bagian kecil supaya bisa belajar banyak, remote boleh, bersedia
// pindah. Jangan diganti dengan bahasa lamaran yang generik.
//
// Nomor telepon tidak ditayangkan.
---

<section class="section close" id="contact" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="section__label">Now</span>
    <h2 id="closing-title" class="rise">Where this leaves me</h2>

    <div class="close__grid">
      <div class="close__text rise">
        <p class="close__line">
          I finished in July. I am looking for work now, not in November.
        </p>
        <p>
          What I want is a team with a process I can learn from, and I would
          rather be the least experienced person in that room than the most
          experienced in a smaller one. Remote works. So does moving.
        </p>
        <p>
          If anything above is useful to you, email is the fastest way to reach
          me. I answer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="close__links rise">
        <a class="close__mail" href="mailto:dwiiyudaaa@gmail.com">
          dwiiyudaaa@gmail.com
        </a>
        <ul class="close__list">
          <li>
            <a class="figure" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dwiyuda"
              >linkedin.com/in/dwiyuda</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="figure" href="https://github.com/Dwiyuda"
              >github.com/Dwiyuda</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="caption close__where">Pekanbaru, Riau, Indonesia</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="caption colophon">
      Built with Astro. It sets no cookies and runs no analytics. Every figure
      on this page traces back to a document, and the source is
      <a href="https://github.com/Dwiyuda/WEB_PORTOFOLIO" rel="noopener"
        >on GitHub</a
      >.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .close__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 52rem) {
    .close__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 16rem;
      gap: 3.5rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .close__text {
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }

  .close__line {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 1.15rem + 1.2vw, 1.95rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-variation-settings: "SOFT" 40, "WONK" 1;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .close__text p + p {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .close__mail {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.95rem + 0.3vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--verified);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--verified) 40%, transparent);
    transition: border-color var(--t-fast) var(--ease);
  }

  .close__mail:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--verified);
  }

  .close__list {
    margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .close__list li + li {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .close__where {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .colophon {
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin-top: 4rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
</style>
